    ],
    "cover": "media/reel-ex13-free-hit/2-cover.jpg",
    "caption": "No-ball. Now the field is frozen. 🏏\n\nIn white-ball cricket, every no-ball brings a free hit. If the same batter is on strike, the fielding side can't change the field. Caught or bowled doesn't count. The only ways out: run out, obstructing the field, or hitting the ball twice.\n\nBest free hit you've ever seen? Comment 👇\n\n#CricketTactics #FreeHit #T20 #CricketRules #Cricket"
  },
